    "description": "Stop the socket receive loop after a completed protocol callback deliberately closes its context. Preserve TREE_DISCONNECT and LOGOFF NTSTATUS errors through the existing errno callback instead of fabricating allocation failure or success. Guest/signing/encryption and stat access remain unchanged.",
